摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Flow turns a WORKFLOW.md and its step-level STEP.md files into an editable diagram inside DeepSeek Harness. The bundled Skill lets the current Session create and maintain workflows through tools, while the diagram and Markdown remain synchronized and portable.","id":"gh:1334460196","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-deepseek-flow","slug":"kanghelyu/dsh-deepseek-flow","topics":["ai-workflow","dark-mode","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh-plugin","flow-editor","markdown","visual-workflow","visualization","workflow","workflow-builder","workflow-management"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Flow turns a WORKFLOW.md and its step-level STEP.md files into an editable diagram inside D"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"eepSeek Harness. The bundled Skill lets the current Session create and maintain workflows through to"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ols, while the diagram and Markdown remain synchronized and portable."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DeepSeek Flow"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"See the workflow. Keep Markdown portable. Review only real canvas edits."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A visual, Markdown-first workflow editor built for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"🌐 Official website — deepseekflow.kanghelyu.org"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"DeepSeek Flow turns a `WORKFLOW.md` and its step-level `STEP.md` files into an editable diagram insi"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"de DeepSeek Harness. The bundled Skill lets the current Session create and maintain workflows throug"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"h tools, while the diagram and Markdown remain synchronized and portable."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"It is intentionally an editor—not a workflow runtime. DeepSeek Flow helps you design, inspect, and i"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"mprove a workflow; execution remains in the current Session."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## What it gives you"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Markdown as the source of truth** — one master `WORKFLOW.md`, plus one `STEP.md` workspace for e"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ach step.\n- **A real visual editor** — create, move, connect, reconnect, label, and delete nodes and"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" arrows.\n- **Two-way synchronization** — edits made on the canvas and in the Markdown editor are wri"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"tten back to the workflow files.\n- **Source-aware topology transactions** — human canvas edits recei"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ve a full current-Session review; topology produced by direct Session file edits can use an invisibl"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"e deterministic finalize path instead of being sent back to the same Session.\n- **Executable gate se"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"mantics** — the exported contract includes formulas, operands, predicates, and deterministic Boolean"},{"id":"p10s8","text":" results without running Agent steps.\n- **Per-session isolation** — each Harness session keeps its o"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"wn workflows, with optional shared templates; the canvas toolbar can delete the current workflow or "},{"id":"p10s10","text":"shared template behind a guarded confirm (managed workspaces move to a trash area and can be recover"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"ed).\n- **Comfortable large-flow navigation** — collapsible and resizable side panels, pan and zoom, "},{"id":"p10s12","text":"fit-to-view, animated node focus, and independent scrolling regions; node drags commit once on point"},{"id":"p10s13","text":"er release and background sync polls lightweight revisions, so large graphs stay smooth.\n- **Native "},{"id":"p10s14","text":"theme support** — the interface follows Harness light and dark themes and the active WebUI language."},{"id":"p10s15","text":"\n- **Manual AI assistance** — run logic validation, optimize one document with review, or optimize t"},{"id":"p10s16","text":"he complete workflow.\n- **Background AI jobs** — switching documents, views, or sessions does not in"},{"id":"p10s17","text":"terrupt accepted jobs; document proposals are restored when you return.\n- **Persistent results and d"},{"id":"p10s18","text":"rafts** — logic-validation findings, AI proposals, and unapplied canvas drafts are persisted to disk"},{"id":"p10s19","text":": view switches, session switches, and `dsh web` restarts lose nothing; they are cleared only by an "},{"id":"p10s20","text":"explicit discard or a successful commit. Markdown edits inside the 650 ms autosave window are flushe"},{"id":"p10s21","text":"d immediately when you leave the view.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Install from GitHub into the Web profile:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, open a session, and select the **DeepSeek Flow** tab."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"To confirm that the plugin is mounted:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Your first workflow"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. In a Session, ask the Agent to **build a workflow** or **import a workflow**. The bundled `deepse"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ek-flow` Skill guides it to `flow_create` or `flow_put`.\n2. Open **DeepSeek Flow**. The plugin scaff"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"olds a master document, step documents, and their visual layout.\n3. Ask the Session Agent to change "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"the workflow files, or select a document and edit its Markdown directly.\n4. Direct Session/file-driv"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"en topology updates are finalized without another main-Session review. The Agent should call `flow_f"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"inalize_canvas`; if it forgets, Studio falls back to detecting that no canvas edit event occurred an"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"d presses the same invisible finalize action automatically.\n5. When **you** add, remove, rename, or "},{"id":"p18s8","text":"connect boxes on the canvas, click **Apply changes**. DeepSeek Flow validates the graph, asks the cu"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"rrent Session Agent to review it, validates again, and atomically saves a new revision.\n6. Return to"},{"id":"p18s10","text":" the Session when you want the Agent to execute the workflow."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"A typical workflow directory looks like this:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Agent tools"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| `flow_create` | Create a documented linear or branched workflow and save it in the current Session"},{"id":"p23s2","text":". |\n| `flow_list` / `flow_read` | Discover workflows and read the master document, step documents, r"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"evision, graph, and logic contract. Both also return the session's `activeFlowId`, plus a one-shot `"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"activeFlowNotice` after the user switches the active workflow in Studio — the agent should then run "},{"id":"p23s5","text":"the switched workflow and ignore earlier instructions about other workflows; without a notice, keep "},{"id":"p23s6","text":"the conversation seamless. |\n| `flow_put` | Import or atomically update a complete flow definition. "},{"id":"p23s7","text":"A successful call is already persisted. |\n| `flow_evaluate` | Evaluate Boolean gates from upstream v"},{"id":"p23s8","text":"alues without running Agent steps. |\n| `flow_finalize_canvas` | After direct file edits, queue Studi"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"o's invisible deterministic finalize action and skip a redundant main-Session review. |\n| `flow_dele"},{"id":"p23s10","text":"te` | Delete a Session flow or shared template; managed workspaces are moved to trash. |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The Skill is registered reactively when the Harness `skills` service becomes available. Its `SKILL.m"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"d` contains real Markdown after frontmatter, so filesystem and runtime providers never return an emp"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ty instruction body."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Active workflow & cross-session switching"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The Studio toolbar's workflow dropdown lists **every historical workflow**, grouped by origin: curre"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"nt session first, other sessions next, shared templates last. Switching to another session's workflo"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"w imports an independent copy of its document workspace into the current session — external custom `"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"docRoot`s are referenced, never copied. Shared templates are also copied into the current session's "},{"id":"p26s5","text":"own managed workspace on switch, so edits never pollute the shared original."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
